<title>USA: Wind River sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Wind River sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ALAMEDA, Calif 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wind River Systems Inc said Friday its board had authorized a three-for-two stock split, payable March 10, record February 24.</p>
</text>
